  --apply-pay-grade: oneof<nothing, bool> # Apply pay grade indicates that after submitting the record the server will replace the value of `grossWage` with the value represented by the selected `payGrade`. A pay grade contains time based values, the value that is active on the `start date` of the record will be selected. (nullable, e.g. true)
